  <data name="Refs_Example_slime_Title" xml:space="preserve"><value>Slime</value></data>
  <data name="Refs_Example_slime_Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>16×16 green slime character. Dark green 1px outline, top-left light, a 4-shade green ramp shifting toward yellow with a top-left highlight and bottom-right shadow, and big 2×2 eyes so it reads at small size.</value></data>
  <data name="Refs_Example_slime_Tags" xml:space="preserve"><value>slime, monster, enemy, 16px</value></data>
  <data name="Refs_Example_sword_Title" xml:space="preserve"><value>Sword</value></data>
  <data name="Refs_Example_sword_Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>16×16 diagonal sword item icon. Indigo 1px outline, top-left light giving a 3-shade blade (white left edge, blue-grey right edge), a gold guard, brown grip and red pommel to separate materials.</value></data>
  <data name="Refs_Example_sword_Tags" xml:space="preserve"><value>sword, weapon, item, icon, 16px</value></data>
  <data name="Refs_Example_hero_Title" xml:space="preserve"><value>Hero</value></data>
  <data name="Refs_Example_hero_Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>32×32 front-facing chibi character. Head larger than half the height, dark purple 1px outline, top-left light with 3-shade hair, skin and clothing ramps, and a symmetric silhouette with highlights only on the left.</value></data>
  <data name="Refs_Example_hero_Tags" xml:space="preserve"><value>hero, character, person, front, chibi, 32px</value></data>
  <data name="Refs_Example_slime_bounce_Title" xml:space="preserve"><value>Slime bounce</value></data>
  <data name="Refs_Example_slime_bounce_Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>4-frame 16×16 slime jump animation at 120 ms per frame: rest, squash, stretch in the air, land. Only the shape changes; outline, shading and eye placement follow the still sprite.</value></data>
  <data name="Refs_Example_slime_bounce_Tags" xml:space="preserve"><value>slime, monster, animation, jump, squash, 16px</value></data>
  <data name="Refs_Example_grass_Title" xml:space="preserve"><value>Grass tile</value></data>
  <data name="Refs_Example_grass_Description" xml:space="preserve"><value>16×16 grass-topped dirt ground tile. A 3-shade green grass top, a jagged dark border, then 3-shade brown dirt with scattered pebble specks; the left and right edges match so it repeats horizontally without seams.</value></data>
  <data name="Refs_Example_grass_Tags" xml:space="preserve"><value>grass, dirt, ground, tile, repeat, 16px</value></data>
